From 42c29cb15f816dd263781871f4432f59c854f333 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: austin62jake <340374338+austin62jake@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:39:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): MCP detect_holes, through the app's own Detect
 holes rule

Drill, Bore and Thread machine only the holes in their parameters,
which only the UI's Detect holes button could fill, so over MCP they
always refused (#312). The rule moves into operation::detect_holes;
the button and a new MCP tool detect_holes both call it and commit one
undoable parameter edit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
